---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Refund Policy | Men's Post-Divorce Coaching">
    <section class="legal-page">
        <div class="container container-narrow">
            <header class="legal-header">
                <p class="legal-breadcrumb">LEGAL DOCUMENTS</p>
                <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
                <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: February 7, 2026</p>
            </header>

            <div class="legal-content">
                <section>
                    <h2>1. Digital Products and Services</h2>
                    <p>Due to the nature of digital goods and the immediate access to restricted content, frameworks, and community resources, we generally do not offer refunds once access has been granted. However, we stand behind the quality of our work and want ensuring you have the best experience possible.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>2. Satisfaction Guarantee</h2>
                    <p>Specific programs may carry a limited satisfaction guarantee as explicitly stated on the program's sales or checkout page at the time of purchase. If a program includes such a guarantee, the terms outlined on that page will govern the refund process.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>3. Coaching Sessions</h2>
                    <p>Coaching sessions must be cancelled or rescheduled at least 24 hours in advance to be eligible for potential credit or refund. Missed sessions or same-day cancellations are non-refundable.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>4. Refund Process</h2>
                    <p>To request a refund under an applicable guarantee, please contact our support team at support@menspostdivorcecoaching.com with your order details and the specific reason for your request. All requests are reviewed on a case-by-case basis.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>5. Contact Information</h2>
                    <p>If you have any questions about our refund policy, please reach out to us at our main Sheridan, WY headquarters or via the support email listed above.</p>
                </section>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-page {
        padding: 8rem 0;
        background-color: #fff;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .container-narrow {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 2rem;
    }

    .legal-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 5rem;
    }

    .legal-breadcrumb {
        color: var(--color-accent);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        color: var(--color-bg-primary);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .last-updated {
        color: #888;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
        color: var(--color-bg-primary);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        text-transform: none;
        letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .legal-content p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #444;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
</style>
